## Import

Import an existing membership using `cloud_id/affinity_group_id/server_id`.

```bash
terraform import hpe_morpheus_cloud_affinity_group_member.example 15056/6221/572308
```

-> A membership has no identifier of its own — it is the pairing that exists, not an
object — so all three parts are required.

~> An instance provisioned with `config_vmware.affinity_group_id` joins the group directly.
That membership is not managed by this resource unless you import it.
